	"Description": "Backpacks (M11 G6, combat-loadout-mods.md §10): Helldivers-style backpacks attached on top of the kit implant through the standard connector. The backpack asset is data (look, abilities with command bindings, passives, effects); the player's backpack is a loadout extension kept through a kit swap. Everything it does is an ability granted by the loadout compile; nothing of this plugin runs in the simulation.",
